---
title: "RCC child execution and lease lifetime"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Execution requested
  s1: Lease held
  s2: Command and supervisor prepared
  s3: Child not started#59; cleanup pending
  s4: Failure returned
  s5: Child running under lease
  s6: Child termination requested
  s7: Child reaped#59; cleanup pending
  s8: Execution succeeded
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: acquire execution lease
  s1 --> s2: resolve command and prepare supervisor
  s1 --> s3: command or setup rejected
  s2 --> s5: start child
  s3 --> s4: release lease and return result or lease release fails#59; return error
  s2 --> s3: child cannot start
  s5 --> s6: cancel or fail supervisor attachment
  s5 --> s7: wait for child
  s6 --> s7: wait for child
  s7 --> s4: release lease and return result or lease release fails#59; return error
  s7 --> s8: release lease and return result
